    "detailed_description": "<strong>Uncover the secrets of the cave or face your fate.</strong><br><br>In this thrilling adventure, you step into the shoes of a death row inmate given one last chance to avoid execution. Your task? To explore the uncharted depths of a perilous cave and document its mysteries. This is no ordinary cave\u2014it's teeming with bizarre creatures, unusual plants, and mysterious ores, each with unique properties waiting to be discovered.<br><br><strong><u>Explore and Document</u></strong><br><br>Your primary goal is to investigate every nook and cranny of the cave, leaving no stone unturned. The cave is a labyrinthine ecosystem brimming with:<br><br><strong>Monsters: </strong>Each with unique behaviors and vulnerabilities. Use your wits to understand how different ores affect them and log every detail.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/6d7ab77c682613b9403115e76ba41258.poster.avif?t=1741521681\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/6d7ab77c682613b9403115e76ba41258.webm?t=1741521681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/6d7ab77c682613b9403115e76ba41258.mp4?t=1741521681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Plants:</strong> Discover various plants, each with distinctive effects when consumed. Some might enhance your abilities, others could provide essential clues, but all are crucial to your survival and documentation.<br><br><strong>Ores:</strong> Collect ores that possess special properties when thrown. These ores can create strategic advantages against monsters or help solve intricate puzzles.<br><br><strong>Points of Interest:</strong> Every hidden corner, ancient relic, and mysterious artifact must be thoroughly explored and recorded.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/36722dfe562251b2b6040e9fabeb3d03.poster.avif?t=1741521681\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/36722dfe562251b2b6040e9fabeb3d03.webm?t=1741521681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/36722dfe562251b2b6040e9fabeb3d03.mp4?t=1741521681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Puzzle Solving:</strong> The cave is riddled with puzzles that guard its secrets. Use your intellect and the tools at your disposal to unlock these mysteries and progress further.<br><br>Master the art of survival as you delve deeper into the cave's enigmatic environment. Your logbook isn't just a record\u2014it's your lifeline. Accurately noting how ores interact with monsters and the effects of plants can mean the difference between life and death.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Uncover the secrets of the cave or face your fate.</strong><br><br>In this thrilling adventure, you step into the shoes of a death row inmate given one last chance to avoid execution. Your task? To explore the uncharted depths of a perilous cave and document its mysteries. This is no ordinary cave\u2014it's teeming with bizarre creatures, unusual plants, and mysterious ores, each with unique properties waiting to be discovered.<br><br><strong><u>Explore and Document</u></strong><br><br>Your primary goal is to investigate every nook and cranny of the cave, leaving no stone unturned. The cave is a labyrinthine ecosystem brimming with:<br><br><strong>Monsters: </strong>Each with unique behaviors and vulnerabilities. Use your wits to understand how different ores affect them and log every detail.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/6d7ab77c682613b9403115e76ba41258.poster.avif?t=1741521681\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/6d7ab77c682613b9403115e76ba41258.webm?t=1741521681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/6d7ab77c682613b9403115e76ba41258.mp4?t=1741521681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Plants:</strong> Discover various plants, each with distinctive effects when consumed. Some might enhance your abilities, others could provide essential clues, but all are crucial to your survival and documentation.<br><br><strong>Ores:</strong> Collect ores that possess special properties when thrown. These ores can create strategic advantages against monsters or help solve intricate puzzles.<br><br><strong>Points of Interest:</strong> Every hidden corner, ancient relic, and mysterious artifact must be thoroughly explored and recorded.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/36722dfe562251b2b6040e9fabeb3d03.poster.avif?t=1741521681\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/36722dfe562251b2b6040e9fabeb3d03.webm?t=1741521681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152600/extras/36722dfe562251b2b6040e9fabeb3d03.mp4?t=1741521681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Puzzle Solving:</strong> The cave is riddled with puzzles that guard its secrets. Use your intellect and the tools at your disposal to unlock these mysteries and progress further.<br><br>Master the art of survival as you delve deeper into the cave's enigmatic environment. Your logbook isn't just a record\u2014it's your lifeline. Accurately noting how ores interact with monsters and the effects of plants can mean the difference between life and death.",
